  tracks 80
  heads 2
  sides alt
  sectrk 10
  blocksize 2048
  maxdir 64
  dirblks 2
  skew 0
  boottrk 1
  secbase 0
  os 2.2
end

diskdef osborne-8dd
  desc "Osborne 8-inch double density (OCC development discs), 600K: track 0 FM 26 x 128"
  source "Worked out by detection from 7 real Osborne 8-inch source discs (o1next repository; files match that project's own extraction byte for byte). The directory size (128) is the whole-block reading; 96 would read the same discs."
  seclen 1024
  tracks 77
  heads 1
  sectrk 8
  blocksize 2048
  maxdir 128
  skew 3
  boottrk 2
  track0 26 128 fm
  secbase 1
  imdmode 3
  os 2.2
end

